  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "OpenCV 5 decides before the model",
      "items": [
        "Laplacian, calcHist, connectedComponentsWithStats: blur, light, glare (perception/quality.py:65, :107, :85)",
        "SIFT + knnMatch + findHomography(USAC_MAGSAC): same place (imgio.py:88, scene.py:55, :61)",
        "warpPerspective, CLAHE, absdiff, morphologyEx: change per zone (change.py:40, imgio.py:60, change.py:54, :56)",
        "FaceDetectorYN blur before storing or sending (privacy.py:59); YuNet fetched and checksum-checked at image build (Dockerfile:44)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Gate and human control",
      "items": [
        "advance_step runs through a Strands HookRegistry with StepGate (web/gated.py:23, guide.py:926)",
        "Blocking OpenCV report: cancel_tool with OpenCV's reason (gate.py:141, :118)",
        "Place not confirmed: pass only with same_place=true from the two-photo check (gate.py:153)",
        "Change in a do-not-touch zone: interrupt('human_review') (gate.py:91)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Agent mode and limits",
      "items": [
        "At /agent the Strands Guide agent decides the tool calls (inspect_photo, submit_photo, advance_step); same tools, same gate (web/app.py:523, guide.py:777)",
        "Capped: 6 jobs, 30 photo checks, 60 agent turns a day for everyone; at most 8 tool calls per turn (web/limits.py, web/agent_mode.py)",
        "No COOL, no S3 for photos, no AgentCore in this stack"
      ]
    }
  ]
